  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "problem",
      "chapter": "The problem",
      "shot": {
        "type": "deck",
        "slide": 1
      },
      "audio": "vo-problem.mp3",
      "speech": 13.44,
      "pad": 0.7,
      "durationInFrames": 425,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "Every prediction market on DreamDEX expires —",
          "start": 0.081,
          "end": 2.743041
        },
        {
          "text": "sixty seconds, fifteen minutes, a day.",
          "start": 2.951375,
          "end": 5.555541
        },
        {
          "text": "Liquidity you have to rebuild every window isn't liquidity.",
          "start": 5.914333,
          "end": 9.699083
        },
        {
          "text": "So we built a vault that outlives the markets",
          "start": 10.069458,
          "end": 12.419
        },
        {
          "text": "it quotes.",
          "start": 12.430541,
          "end": 13.101832
        }
      ],
      "words": 32
    },
    {
      "id": "capital",
      "chapter": "Real capital, on the venue",
      "shot": {
        "type": "page",
        "path": "/dashboard",
        "anchor": "#live",
        "needs": "#live"
      },
      "audio": "vo-capital.mp3",
      "speech": 14.424,
      "pad": 0.5,
      "durationInFrames": 448,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "This is the vault, live.",
          "start": 0.092583,
          "end": 1.157416
        },
        {
          "text": "Nine and a half thousand tUSDC of depositor capital,",
          "start": 1.539333,
          "end": 4.687499
        },
        {
          "text": "and a hundred and ninety-three quotes placed inside this",
          "start": 5.081,
          "end": 7.858791
        },
        {
          "text": "venue's own book —",
          "start": 7.858791,
          "end": 8.958333
        },
        {
          "text": "real money, at prices it had to honour.",
          "start": 9.49075,
          "end": 11.631916
        },
        {
          "text": "Not a reading of the venue.",
          "start": 12.002333,
          "end": 13.009249
        },
        {
          "text": "A position in it.",
          "start": 13.368041,
          "end": 14.085624
        }
      ],
      "words": 44
    },
    {
      "id": "impact",
      "chapter": "Seventy windows, rebuilt twice",
      "shot": {
        "type": "deck",
        "slide": 5
      },
      "audio": "vo-impact.mp3",
      "speech": 16.728,
      "pad": 1,
      "durationInFrames": 532,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "Which means we can be asked whether the book",
          "start": 0.092583,
          "end": 1.608791
        },
        {
          "text": "got better.",
          "start": 1.608791,
          "end": 2.233791
        },
        {
          "text": "We rebuilt seventy of the windows we've quoted, twice,",
          "start": 2.604166,
          "end": 5.775458
        },
        {
          "text": "from the venue's own order rows —",
          "start": 5.925916,
          "end": 7.685207
        },
        {
          "text": "once with our orders in, once with them taken",
          "start": 8.055541,
          "end": 9.965291
        },
        {
          "text": "out.",
          "start": 9.976833,
          "end": 10.266166
        },
        {
          "text": "Twenty-three percent narrower with us in it.",
          "start": 10.648166,
          "end": 12.858791
        },
        {
          "text": "Tighter on sixty-six of seventy, wider on none.",
          "start": 13.229166,
          "end": 16.377291
        }
      ],
      "words": 51
    },
    {
      "id": "custody",
      "chapter": "What the operator key cannot do",
      "shot": {
        "type": "deck",
        "slide": 7
      },
      "audio": "vo-custody.mp3",
      "speech": 13.608,
      "pad": 0.5,
      "durationInFrames": 424,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "BinaryPool has no operator gate: a bot key that",
          "start": 0.104166,
          "end": 3.287041
        },
        {
          "text": "can trade can also withdraw.",
          "start": 3.287041,
          "end": 4.675916
        },
        {
          "text": "Ours owns its own orders instead.",
          "start": 5.046291,
          "end": 6.932832
        },
        {
          "text": "The operator key picks a price and a size —",
          "start": 7.291666,
          "end": 9.826374
        },
        {
          "text": "it cannot move a token, and there is no",
          "start": 10.162041,
          "end": 12.233833
        },
        {
          "text": "function that would let it.",
          "start": 12.245375,
          "end": 13.263916
        }
      ],
      "words": 43
    },
    {
