        {
          "text": "A hundred and forty-six tests, nine against the real",
          "start": 0.092583,
          "end": 3.043999
        },
        {
          "text": "venue on a fork, and every one of the",
          "start": 3.044,
          "end": 5.127333
        },
        {
          "text": "twenty-six properties in an independent ERC-4626 conformance",
          "start": 5.127333,
          "end": 9.930541
        },
        {
          "text": "suite —",
          "start": 9.930541,
          "end": 10.312499
        },
        {
          "text": "the standard's rules, not ours.",
          "start": 10.706,
          "end": 12.731458
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninety-seven percent line coverage on the vault, and",
          "start": 13.101833,
          "end": 15.972208
        },
        {
          "text": "all forty-three of its functions.",
          "start": 15.983791,
          "end": 17.662041
        }
      ],
      "words": 44
    },
    {
      "id": "reactivity",
      "chapter": "Nobody called this",
      "shot": {
        "type": "explorer",
        "tx": "0x2f75001ea73bd66cf62649841542a2d8b74cad22afa1513e5e6463730a009f50"
      },
      "audio": "vo-reactivity.mp3",
      "speech": 12.36,
      "pad": 0.8,
      "durationInFrames": 395,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "A window expired at seventeen hundred UTC.",
          "start": 0.092583,
          "end": 2.986083
        },
        {
          "text": "No bot ran, nobody called anything.",
          "start": 3.344916,
          "end": 5.254625
        },
        {
          "text": "Somnia's reactivity precompile woke the vault at the",
          "start": 5.625,
          "end": 8.819458
        },
        {
          "text": "second it was armed for, and it settled its",
          "start": 8.831,
          "end": 11.331041
        },
        {
          "text": "own position.",
          "start": 11.342583,
          "end": 12.013875
        }
      ],
      "words": 32
    },
    {
      "id": "honest",
      "chapter": "The number that was wrong",
      "shot": {
        "type": "page",
        "path": "/dashboard",
        "anchor": "#pnlChart",
        "needs": "#ledger"
      },
      "audio": "vo-honest.mp3",
      "speech": 17.112,
      "pad": 0.8,
      "durationInFrames": 538,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "Now the uncomfortable part.",
          "start": 0.081,
          "end": 1.388875
        },
        {
          "text": "This project once published a two point three seven",
          "start": 1.75925,
          "end": 4.976833
        },
        {
          "text": "percent return.",
          "start": 4.976833,
          "end": 5.729166
        },
        {
          "text": "That number was wrong: the ledger summed the episodes",
          "start": 6.111125,
          "end": 8.680541
        },
        {
          "text": "that closed into a complete set and dropped the",
          "start": 8.680541,
          "end": 10.937499
        },
        {
          "text": "ones that went one-sided, so it could not produce",
          "start": 10.9375,
          "end": 13.460624
        },
        {
          "text": "a loss.",
          "start": 13.460666,
          "end": 14.050916
        },
        {
          "text": "We found it ourselves and published the correction.",
          "start": 14.421291,
          "end": 16.782416
        }
      ],
      "words": 52
    },
    {
      "id": "completing",
      "chapter": "Buying the missing side",
      "shot": {
        "type": "deck",
        "slide": 6
      },
      "audio": "vo-completing.mp3",
      "speech": 31.344,
      "pad": 0.8,
      "durationInFrames": 965,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "Today, honestly: depositors are down two percent, and",
          "start": 0.092583,
          "end": 3.530083
        },
        {
          "text": "one in five filled quotes goes adverse.",
          "start": 3.541666,
          "end": 5.509291
        },
        {
          "text": "That's the real risk —",
          "start": 5.902791,
          "end": 7.141207
        },
        {
          "text": "one leg fills, the market walks away from the",
          "start": 7.523166,
          "end": 10.3125
        },
        {
          "text": "other, and the vault holds a direction worth one",
          "start": 10.3125,
          "end": 12.696749
        },
        {
          "text": "or nothing.",
          "start": 12.69675,
          "end": 13.182874
        },
        {
          "text": "Twenty-six of those, carried to settlement, averaged",
          "start": 13.564833,
          "end": 16.701374
        },
        {
          "text": "minus thirty percent, with a minus one hundred in",
          "start": 16.712958,
          "end": 19.479166
        },
        {
          "text": "them.",
          "start": 19.49075,
          "end": 19.699083
        },
        {
          "text": "So the vault stopped carrying them: it buys the",
          "start": 20.069458,
          "end": 22.326375
        },
        {
          "text": "missing side, and the pair is worth exactly one",
          "start": 22.326375,
          "end": 25.127291
        },
        {
          "text": "either way.",
          "start": 25.127333,
          "end": 25.659707
        },
        {
          "text": "Fourteen so far, averaging minus one percent, worst minus",
          "start": 26.076375,
          "end": 29.872666
        },
        {
          "text": "three and a half.",
          "start": 29.88425,
          "end": 31.018499
        }
      ],
      "words": 89
    },
    {
      "id": "sdk",
      "chapter": "Sixteen defects, each with a hash",
      "shot": {
        "type": "deck",
        "slide": 8
      },
      "audio": "vo-sdk.mp3",
      "speech": 14.736,
      "pad": 0.6,
      "durationInFrames": 461,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "Sixteen reproducible defects in DreamDEX and its SDK,",
          "start": 0.092583,
          "end": 4.004625
        },
        {
          "text": "each one with a transaction hash.",
          "start": 4.502333,
          "end": 6.284749
        },
        {
          "text": "A pool freezes its whole order book the moment",
          "start": 6.655083,
          "end": 9.247666
        },
        {
          "text": "a window expires —",
          "start": 9.247666,
          "end": 10.428208
        },
        {
          "text": "including the calls the SDK documents as the way",
          "start": 10.671291,
          "end": 13.391207
        },
        {
          "text": "to get your escrow out.",
          "start": 13.391208,
          "end": 14.398124
        }
      ],
      "words": 40
    },
